This extension provides an API for communicating with Redis database,
a persistent key-value database with built-in net interface written
in ANSI-C for Posix systems.

PECL redis for php82 of azsupport/ports, without compression, built from
ext/redis of the release tarball of azsupport/php-src, which bundles it:
lib/php/20220829/redis.so, loaded by its ini in etc/php82/conf.d.

One of the four packages of redis, which have the same files:
php82-redis-lz4, php82-redis-zstd, php82-redis-lz4-zstd are the others
(only one of them installs).
